{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S11、S12等短停留段的大字明显更长，多层意思挤在同一段里，扫读速度和视觉呼吸感不如X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y最大的优势是把人物的动机、情绪转折和前后因果直接放进大字，不必依赖容易被扫过的小字，观众更容易明白他为什么怀念、为什么犹豫、又为什么最终决定继续生活。它也更细腻地呈现了从怀念、心酸、疲惫到重新获得生活动力的过程，不只是罗列情绪和结论。X的层次和扫读节奏更好，但部分关键解释藏在小字里，普通观众容易只看到情绪结论而没完全接住人物的心理变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "45d01c7a-c486-4441-a6db-a44b685f3091", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T195706139379Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:57:58.798818+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d7f2719836923f3a9b40535147afe57b0b7a5bda59b5dd79d23886d1475de32e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen